SUMMARY:STLA — Call #1
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: STELLANTIS FINL SVCS US CORP (STLA)\nRoadshow: URL: www.netroadsho
 w.com | Access Code: SFS26 (not case sensitive) | Direct Link: www.netroad
 show.com/nrs/home/#!/?show=acba3be6\n\nDeal context:\nStellantis Financial
  Services US Corp. (SFS)\, the US-based captive finance subsidiary of glob
 al automaker Stellantis N.V. (STLA)\, rated Baa3/BBB- (Moody's/S&P)\, has 
 mandated six joint active bookrunners — BBVA\, BNP Paribas\, BofA Securiti
 es\, J.P. Morgan\, UniCredit\, and Wells Fargo Securities — to arrange fix
 ed income investor calls beginning September 21\, 2026\, ahead of a 3-year
  fixed and/or floating USD Benchmark 144A/Reg S senior unsecured notes off
 ering. The deal is at the Mandate stage with investor calls scheduled acro
 ss two days (September 21–22\, 2026)\, subject to market conditions\, with
  BNP Paribas coordinating marketing logistics.
